<title>USA: MasTec gets larger credit facility.</title>
<headline>MasTec gets larger credit facility.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>MasTec Inc said Tuesday Fleet Financial Corp has increased its existing credit facility to MasTec from $40 million to $50 million.</p>
<p>The company said it would use the extra money to buy equipment, make capital expenditures, and use it as working capital and other purposes.</p>
<p>MasTec is a provider of telecommunications and related infrastructure services.</p>
</text>
